---
source: core/src/orchestrator/tests/mod.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Manage user's long-term goals with hierarchical decomposition and progress tracking.\n\nACTIONS:\n- create: New goal (requires title). Use parent_goal_id for sub-goals.\n- update: Change title/description/progress_pct/target_date\n- list: Show goals (default: active only; use status_filter for others)\n- complete/pause/resume/abandon: Change goal status\n- add_milestone: Add a milestone checkpoint to a goal\n- complete_milestone: Mark a milestone as done (auto-updates progress)\n- get: Get full details of a single goal\n\nWhen user discusses plans, ambitions, or projects — create goals proactively.\nWhen milestones are done or progress is made — update proactively.\nNever create/update goals or progress from snippets/previews/truncated/no-text sources unless the full source or user confirmation is available.\nSource 'inferred' for goals detected from conversation; 'explicit' when user says directly."
name: manage_goals
parameters:
  properties:
    action:
      description: Goal management action
      enum:
        - create
        - update
        - list
        - complete
        - pause
        - resume
        - abandon
        - add_milestone
        - complete_milestone
        - get
      type: string
    description:
      description: Goal description with context
      type: string
    goal_id:
      description: Goal ID (required for update/complete/pause/resume/abandon/add_milestone/complete_milestone/get)
      type: integer
    milestone_index:
      description: 0-based milestone index (for complete_milestone)
      type: integer
    milestone_title:
      description: Milestone title (for add_milestone)
      type: string
    parent_goal_id:
      description: Parent goal ID for sub-goals
      type: integer
    progress_pct:
      description: Progress as 0.0-1.0 (for update)
      type: number
    source:
      description: "Goal source: explicit (user said) or inferred (detected from conversation). Default: explicit"
      enum:
        - explicit
        - inferred
      type: string
    source_summary:
      description: Optional evidence summary. Unconfirmed preview/truncated/no-text sources require the full source or user confirmation before asserting progress or decisions.
      type: string
    status_filter:
      description: "Status filter for list (default: active; 'all' shows every status)"
      enum:
        - active
        - paused
        - completed
        - abandoned
        - all
      type: string
    target_date:
      description: Target completion date (ISO 8601)
      type: string
    title:
      description: Goal title (required for create)
      type: string
  required:
    - action
  type: object
